# Attribution Requirements for TimeCapsule

In addition to the terms of the MIT License, any use or distribution of this software must include a clear reference to the original author:

1. In applications, a credit "Based on TimeCapsule by TypTech" with a link to https://github.com/TypTech/TimeCapsule must appear in the "About"/"Credits" section.

2. On websites or online services, a visible link to the original repository page must be displayed.

3. In documentation and source code, reference to the original repository must be included.

Failure to comply with these attribution requirements constitutes a violation of the terms of use.
